{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49036","headline":"牡丹 · 文丙","name":"牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万物承春各鬬奇，百花分贵近亭池。\n开时若也姮娥见，落日那堪公子知。\n诗客筵中金琖满，美人头上玉钗垂。\n不同寒菊舒重九，只拟清香泛酒巵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"文丙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}